<!--
  The notification small icon.

  Android tints small icons to a flat white silhouette and discards colour
  entirely, so this is a shape and nothing else — a coloured or detailed icon
  comes out as a white blob. The eight-pointed star is the app's own motif: the
  ✦ that marks every card chip, and the engraving on the tarot card back.

  Without this, Capacitor falls back to its generic default icon, which is what
  the first on-device test showed in the shade — an unbranded mark next to a
  reading, which reads as some other app's notification.
-->
